  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Human path’s specialty is support, because human path dao marks will not interrupt other paths’ dao marks or conflict with them. Unless human path methods of at least rank eight are used, those support effects cannot be resolved by ordinary means.",
      "chapters": [
        1729
