        "move_mutual_injuries",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Self cleansing eliminates harmful dao marks on the user’s body, and Fang Yuan uses it to strip the human path dao marks from himself. As long as a single human path dao mark remains on him, Shen Shang can follow that connection to attack while bypassing Myriad Year Flying Warship.",
